WEBVTT

00:03:29.965 --> 00:03:32.519
ambapo mwanamume anaajiriwa na jamii

00:03:32.519 --> 00:03:35.143
anakuja kambini

00:03:35.143 --> 00:03:37.572
na anafanya mapenzi na watoto wadogo.

00:03:39.252 --> 00:03:41.766
Wazeni kiwewe wasichana hawa

00:03:41.766 --> 00:03:44.516
wanachokisikia kila siku.

00:03:46.766 --> 00:03:49.925
Wasichana wengi wanapata mimba.

00:03:49.925 --> 00:03:52.542
Na hata wanashikwa na ukimwi

00:03:52.542 --> 00:03:54.882
na magonjwa mengine ya zinaa.

00:03:55.692 --> 00:04:00.603
Kwa dadangu mdogo,
alipata mimba.